			"Message": "refactor(Worker): Fix import.meta.env type assertion in telemetry bridge\n\nThe type assertion for `import.meta.env` has been corrected to properly access environment variables in the Worker element's telemetry system. This resolves a type safety issue where the environment object was not being correctly inferred, which could lead to runtime errors in telemetry data collection.\n\nThis change ensures that the telemetry bridge module correctly interfaces with the build environment variables, maintaining accurate type information without altering the telemetry functionality.",
